WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.195
Welcome to Module 5, the last
module of the Azure Security

2
00:00:04.195 --> 00:00:08.163
Engineering learning path:
policy, drift and evidence.

3
00:00:08.163 --> 00:00:11.737
Everything you engineered in
Modules 1 to 4 can drift.

4
00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:14.876
Policy holds it in place
and reports what drifted;

5
00:00:14.876 --> 00:00:19.162
the operating model gives each control
an owner, a cadence and a test;

6
00:00:19.162 --> 00:00:23.601
and the evidence catalog turns both
into what an assessor can inspect.

7
00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:28.850
This module covers Steps 9 and 10 of the
Azure Security Engineering implementation

8
00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:33.860
guide, and takes about fifty minutes, plus
a lab in your own test management group.
